      "prompt": "$\\lim_{x\\to 3}\\dfrac{x^2-9}{x-3}=?$\nA) $0$\nB) $3$\nC) $6$\nD) Does not exist",
      "answer": "C) $6$",
      "solution": {
        "steps": [
